abstract: "Mova is a hybrid combinatorial–operational system in Rust with a Combinatorial Small Language Model at its core. It parses English into Universal Dependencies trees, reads them into frames and a world of the text, and answers from that world; every step is deterministic and can say why. A large model is only an offline teacher."
keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - universal dependencies
  - explainable AI
  - rust
